.direnv/

# VM disk images. `nixos-rebuild build-vm` writes <hostname>.qcow2 into the
# working directory, so running it from the repo root drops one here. They are
# throwaway state for impermanence testing (modules/core/impermanence.nix) and
# grow to virtualisation.diskSize as the VM is used.
*.qcow2
